eNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/omichannel-callback-api.md","line":651},{"title":"Voice Interaction Resource - POST /cs/voice-interactions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/voice-interaction-resource-api.md","line":818},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":867},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":905},{"title":"Time zones","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/r_TimeZones.md","line":1142},{"title":"Voice Interaction Resource - POST /cs/voice-interactions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/voice-interaction-resource-api.md","line":1371},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1446},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1484},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1994},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":2006},{"title":"Time zones","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/r_TimeZones.md","line":2477},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":2715},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":2753},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":3020},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":3045},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":3103}],"metadata":{"title":"Omichannel Callback API","description":"The Omnichannel Callback API provides methods for creating, updating, and initiating a callback request for live agent conversations.Provides actions for integrating third-party Contact Center as a Service \\(CCaaS\\) platforms with ServiceNow's Omnichannel Callback system. This API acts as a bridge, routing callback operations \\(create, update, cancel, close\\) to external CCaaS providers via configurable Workflow Studio subflows.Initiates an interaction for an existing callback, including retry attempts.Initiates a new immediate or scheduled callback request based on details you provide in the request body. For immediate callbacks, this API creates both the callback and interaction. For scheduled callbacks, creates the callback with an appointment ID.Fetches callback information based on query parameters.Updates an existing callback according to details provided in the request.Cancels a given callback request.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/rest-apis/omichannel-callback-api.html","release":"australia","product":"REST APIs","classification":"rest-apis","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":38,"breadcrumb":["REST API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#rest","#table-api","#json","#http","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[97,103],[132,140],[144,148],[160,166],[210,226],[392,398],[484,492],[525,564],[572,609],[615,645],[653,683],[689,705],[711,722],[728,744],[750,761],[822,828],[931,933],[943,945],[955,962],[972,978],[1008,1021],[1025,1034],[1038,1050],[1054,1066],[1119,1130],[1222,1236],[1375,1381],[1510,1517],[1527,1529],[1539,1541],[1551,1557],[1612,1647],[1651,1659],[1663,1671],[1675,1690],[1694,1706],[1710,1722],[1773,1783],[1868,1873],[1885,1887],[1904,1915],[2030,2035],[2045,2050],[2062,2074],[2094,2105],[2278,2293],[2297,2364],[2368,2378],[2382,2401],[2454,2465],[2557,2571],[2779,2781],[2791,2793],[2803,2810],[2820,2826],[2881,2908],[2912,2924],[2928,2940],[2944,2956],[3071,3075],[3082,3091],[3095,3099]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/rest-apis/omichannel-callback-api.md"},
